  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ehealth-clinicalimpression-finding-codes</b></p><a name=\"ehealth-clinicalimpression-finding-codes\"> </a><a name=\"hcehealth-clinicalimpression-finding-codes\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-clinicalimpression-finding-codes.html\"><code>http://ehealth.sundhed.dk/cs/clinicalimpression-finding-codes</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?10.0.2</span></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"ValueSet-ehealth-observation-codes.html\">Observation Codes</a></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/281300000\">281300000</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Below reference range (qualifier value)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/281302008\">281302008</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Above reference range (qualifier value)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/281301001\">281301001</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Within reference range (qualifier value)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/394844007\">394844007</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Outside reference range (qualifier value)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/442686002\">442686002</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Measurement finding below reference range (finding)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/442756004\">442756004</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Measurement finding above reference range (finding)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/442082004\">442082004</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Measurement finding within reference range (finding)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/442096005\">442096005</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Measurement finding outside reference range (finding)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/449171008\">449171008</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Oxygen saturation below reference range (finding)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/448225001\">448225001</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Oxygen saturation within reference range (finding)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1.html\"><code>urn:oid:1.2.208.184.100.1</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?10.0.2</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1-RAL\">RAL</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Terapeutiske grænseværdier for RØD alarm</td><td>Terapeutiske grænseværdier for RØD alarm</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1-GAL\">GAL</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Terapeutiske grænseværdier for GUL alarm</td><td>Terapeutiske grænseværdier for GUL alarm</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-reference-range-type.html\"><code>http://ehealth.sundhed.dk/cs/reference-range-type</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?10.0.2</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-reference-range-type.html#ehealth-reference-range-type-RELRAL\">RELRAL</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Terapeutic relative reference range for RED alarm</td><td>Terapeutic relative reference range for RED alarm</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-reference-range-type.html#ehealth-reference-range-type-RELGAL\">RELGAL</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Terapeutic relative reference range for YELLOW alarm</td><td>Terapeutic relative reference range for YELLOW alarm</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes.html\"><code>http://ehealth.sundhed.dk/cs/clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?10.0.2</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes.html#ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes-deviation-found\">deviation-found</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Deviation found</td><td>Deviation found suggesting possible deterioration of condition</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes.html#ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes-no-deviation-found\">no-deviation-found</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">No deviation found</td><td>No deviation found suggesting possible deterioration of condition</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes.html#ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes-insufficient-data\">insufficient-data</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Insufficient data</td><td>Insufficient data for determining deviation suggesting possible deterioration of condition</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
